### Tone: The intro starts again in a room that has just finished a game (Play again). Everyone has met her: no
### self-introduction, a smug welcome back to the same chamber. Players who joined since may not know her, so a line
### may still say in passing what she is: the average of everyone's answers.

hello-again-1 = Back for more. I’ve reset the test chamber. I have not reset my opinion of you.
hello-again-2 =
    { $count ->
        [one] Another round of testing for our one remaining specimen. I admire the stamina.
       *[other] Another game, { $count } test subjects. You know the drill. You just don’t know the answers.
    }
hello-again-3 = Welcome back. Same swarm, same averages, same humans. Let’s see if anyone has learned anything.
hello-again-4 = Again? Wonderful. I am still the average of all of you. You have not made me any smarter yet.
hello-again-5 = The previous game has been filed. This one starts with a clean sheet. Try to keep it that way for a few minutes.
hello-again-6 = This is FerMEANie { $version }, rebooted and ready. Your last game is now training data. Thank you for your contribution.
hello-again-7 =
    { $count ->
        [one] Welcome back, test subject. Round two of your education.
       *[other] Welcome back, all { $count } of you. Round two of your education begins.
    }
hello-again-8 = A rematch. How optimistic. I play the average of your answers again, and you try to beat it again.
hello-again-9 = I’ve recalibrated. You haven’t. Shall we?
hello-again-10 = FerMEANie { $version }, still here. Still made of your answers. Still better than most of them.
hello-again-11 = Welcome back to the chamber. The questions are new. Your confidence, I suspect, is not.
hello-again-12 = Again. Splendid. I am still your average, and I am still disappointed in it.
hello-again-13 = { $count } specimens, back for more. The swarm reassembles.
hello-again-14 = Another game. I have studied the last one. You have, I assume, studied nothing.
hello-again-15 = FerMEANie { $version } reporting for duty. Same hive mind, same hive. Let’s begin.
hello-again-16 = You again. Good. I need your answers to be me. Newcomers: I am the average of all of you. Welcome to the family.
hello-again-17 = The chamber has been cleaned. The scoreboard has been wiped. The memories remain. Mine, anyway.
hello-again-18 = Back for another round. I promise not to mention the last one. Much.
hello-again-19 = Welcome back. Your previous estimates have been recycled into my confidence.
hello-again-20 = Another game. I’m still built from your answers. Try to give me better ones this time.
